        "TLG7l8OYOPL6nlhxfdOM-"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1691763574,
      "version": 933,
      "versionNonce": 768807466,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784214075714,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Main Line is created base of the use with, on wider screens is mare flater then on phones wher is hill biger.\nBase of main line si define card rotation (0% = -10°; 50% = 0°; 100% = 10° for example).\nOn phones will be shown one dominat card and BEFORE and NEXT card will be hide behin main card.\nOn PC we can show more cards at ones with 16:9 ratio.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Main Line is created base of the use with, on wider screens is mare flater then on phones wher is hill biger.\nBase of main line si define card rotation (0% = -10°; 50% = 0°; 100% = 10° for example).\nOn phones will be shown one dominat card and BEFORE and NEXT card will be hide behin main card.\nOn PC we can show more cards at ones with 16:9 ratio.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
